## Contract Interface

The contract implements the following interface:

- `initialize(admin, name, symbol, total_supply)` - Initialize the contract
- `details()` - Get asset details
- `asset_type()` - Get asset type
- `compliance_model()` - Get compliance model
- `dividend_strategy()` - Get dividend strategy
- `total_supply()` - Get total supply
- `balance(holder)` - Get holder balance
- `is_compliant(holder)` - Check holder compliance status
- `set_compliance(admin, holder, allowed)` - Set holder compliance (admin only)
- `transfer(from, to, amount)` - Transfer tokens
- `create_distribution(admin, amount)` - Create dividend distribution (admin only)
- `distribution(distribution_id)` - Get distribution details
- `dividend_preview(distribution_id, holder)` - Preview dividend for holder
- `claim_dividend(distribution_id, holder)` - Claim dividend
- `version()` - Get contract version

## Configuration Constants

The following constants are embedded at compile time:

- `ASSET_TYPE` = "{{asset_type}}"
- `COMPLIANCE_MODEL` = "{{compliance_model}}"
- `DIVIDEND_STRATEGY` = "{{dividend_strategy}}"